  "details": "Occasionally, when clicking on a text field, the VR keyboard does not seem to appear (or if it does, it appears somewhere far outside of my field of view). When this happened, it continued to happen consistently for at least the rest of the time I was in that instance (I didn't try after changing worlds).\n\nHere's a video showing this happening: https://youtu.be/VFeq2tyzpPk\n\nWorld in which this happened: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_83d67a07-2760-45b6-a129-78a946a4254a/info\n\nTo open the text box in this world, go to one of the go boards, click on the blue tablet, and then click either the Game Review or Debug tabs - either one has a text box that exhibited this issue.\n\nThis issue occurred on the Unity 6 open beta branch. I don't know if it happens on normal open beta, but I never saw something like this prior to the keyboard redesign.",
